---List self-hosted agent runs
---
---Lists, oldest first, the runs the calling service account can claim, and the ones it already holds. A run is listed when its pinned Environment has an active binding for the account, its repository is one the account is a member of and this cell processes, and it is waiting or held by the caller before its deadline. Items are metadata only; claiming a run returns its prompt. A repository paused in Core is refused at claim time, not hidden here. The route is not scoped to a project: bindings say which Environments the account serves, and a runner talks to the cell that processes its project's repositories. Needs a service account token.
---
---`GET /api/v1/self-hosted-runner/jobs`
---@param input? entire.agents.ListSelfHostedRunnerJobsRequest
---@return entire.agents.ConfigPageSelfHostedJob? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_self_hosted_runner_jobs(input) end

